		<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Episode 1: Planet Hulk, Non-Stop, &amp; Damien Jurado]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/episode-1-planet-hulk-non-stop-damien-jurado/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2015 15:24:21 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.steelwagstaff.com/?p=12</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[In the first episode of our <em>Off the Chain</em> podcast, we discuss the meaning of 'Off the Chain,' the <a title="Planet Hulk" href="http://marvel.wikia.com/Planet_Hulk" target="_blank"><em>Planet Hulk</em> </a>storyline from Marvel's <a href="http://marvel.com/universe/Planet_Hulk" target="_blank"><em>The Incredible Hulk</em></a> series, the Liam Neeson film <a title="Non-Stop [2014]" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jiHDJ19A3dk" target="_blank"><em>Non-Stop</em></a>, and the music of <a title="Damien Jurado" href="http://damienjurado.com" target="_blank">Damien Jurado</a>.

We're also including a Damien Jurado sampler playlist with some of Steel's favorite songs, in case you want a taste of his music. The Spotify playlist features music from most of his albums, presented in rough chronological order. You can listen to that below:

http://open.spotify.com/user/steelwagstaff/playlist/0CJfSJ6HaO1J1Q089kvpz0

Enjoy!]]></content:encoded>
