		<title><![CDATA[Episode 15: Over the Top: Top 5 Action Stars, Comic Book Battles, Unchained Melodies, and The Humane Imagination]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/episode-15-over-the-top-top-5-action-stars-comic-book-battles-unchained-melodies-and-the-humane-imagination/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2015 12:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=219</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week Steel was out, so Dave was joined by his old friend Jordan. Together the pair discuss the top 5 action heroes working today, speculate on what would happen if various fictional characters from comic books and movies were to face off in battle, share great music from CHON, The Tallest Man on Earth, Bill Evans, and Three Dog Night, and drop some wisdom on imagination and the good society from Charles L. Black's book <em>The Humane Imagination</em>.

<h2>Links</h2>
<h3>Over the Top</h3>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gB5iDUnx0iY
<h3>Unchained Melodies</h3>
<h4>CHON's live sxsw set</h4>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pxZuPLPERbk
<h4>The Tallest Man on Earth -- Sagres</h4>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u0QIPpBV1D0
<h4>Bill Evans -- My Foolish Heart</h4>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2LFVWBmoiw
<h4>Three Dog Night -- Mama Told Me Not to Come</h4>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rKaQzQAlNn4
<h3>Book Wisdom</h3>
This week Jordan read a passage from <a href="http://www.nytimes.com/2001/05/08/nyregion/charles-l-black-jr-85-constitutional-law-expert-who-wrote-on-impeachment-dies.html?pagewanted=all" target="_blank">Charles L. Black</a>'s <em><a href="http://www.amazon.com/Humane-Imagination-Charles-L/dp/1881987078/ref=sr_1_1?s=books&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1431201358&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=charles+black+the+humane+imagination" target="_blank">The Humane Imagination</a></em>]]></content:encoded>
