https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ai4-auZ18MQ</li>
	<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buffalo_buffalo_Buffalo_buffalo_buffalo_buffalo_Buffalo_buffalo" target="_blank">Buffalo buffalo Buffalo buffalo buffalo buffalo Buffalo buffalo</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Thomas Nashe</h3>
<ul>
	<li><a href="http://www.poetryfoundation.org/bio/thomas-nashe" target="_blank">Nashe's Biography</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Isle_of_Dogs_(play)" target="_blank">Nashe's play <em>The Isle of Dogs</em></a></li>
	<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bishops%27_Ban_of_1599" target="_blank">The Bishops' Ban of 1599</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Unchained Melodies</h3>
<h4>Bob Dylan -- Oxford Town</h4>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XSf_n8RispY
