<h3>Book Wisdom</h3>
This week's passage of Book Wisdom comes from nineteenth century German philosopher Friedrich Nietzsche's <em><a href="http://records.viu.ca/~johnstoi/Nietzsche/genealogytofc.htm" target="_blank">The Genealogy of Morals</a></em>.]]></content:encoded>
