		<title><![CDATA[Episode 69: 2016 in Review, part 2]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/episode-69-2016-in-review-part-2/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 23 Dec 2016 07:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=584</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Here's the second part of our 2016 year in review podcast. Think of it as an early Christmas present from us to you! On this episode Jack Bangerter joins us to talk about the year in art, culture and food, and Aaron Peck comes to talk about all things film. We're pretty happy with how this one turned out, so please enjoy!
<h2>Links</h2>
<h3>Art &amp; Culture with Jack Bangerter</h3>
<h4>Jack's Hairstyle of the Year:</h4>
The Last supper [<em>La Ultimate Cena</em>]

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ig7mvxZ4GvU
<h4>Jack's Art Show of the Year:</h4>
<a href="http://artbasilla.tumblr.com/" target="_blank">John Kilduff's Art Basil LA</a>
<h4>Our TV Recommendations from 2016:</h4>
<ul>
 	<li><em>Trailer Park Boys</em> [Jack]</li>
 	<li>HBO's <em>Night Of</em> [Jack]</li>
 	<li><em>Detectorists</em> [Steel]</li>
 	<li>Maria Bamford’s <em>Lady Dynamite</em> [Steel]</li>
 	<li><em>Stranger Things</em> [Dave]</li>
 	<li>Rewatch <em>30 Rock </em>[Dave]</li>
</ul>
<h3>The Year in Film with <a href="http://www.highdefdigest.com/author/aaron-peck.html" target="_blank">Aaron Peck</a></h3>
<h4>Top 5 movies this year that you probably didn’t see</h4>
<ul>
<ul>
 	<li>The Witch</li>
</ul>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iQXmlf3Sefg
<ul>
<ul>
 	<li>Krisha</li>
</ul>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wnX_lLuENfI
<ul>
<ul>
 	<li>Swiss Army Man</li>
</ul>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4v92gXetGqA
<ul>
<ul>
 	<li>Cameraperson</li>
</ul>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jx52F4iLTL8
<ul>
<ul>
 	<li>Manchester by the Sea</li>
</ul>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gsVoD0pTge0
<h4>Best performance by the Rock in 2016</h4>
<ul>
 	<li><em>Central Intellegence</em> [the misspelling here is soooo fitting, Dave]</li>
 	<li><em>Ballers</em> (HBO) [Aaron]</li>
</ul>
<h4>Surprising film you really enjoyed</h4>
<ul>
 	<li>The Shallows [Aaron]</li>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vPOpE-_42as
<h4>Family film that you were into</h4>
<ul>
 	<li>Pete’s Dragon [Aaron]</li>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPOamb6d_20
<ul>
 	<li>Trolls [Dave]</li>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xyjm5VQ11TQ
<h3>What are you looking forward to in 2017</h3>
<ul>
 	<li>John Wick 2!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! [Aaron]</li>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ChpLV9AMqm4
<ul>
 	<li>Fate of the Furious!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! [Dave]</li>
</ul>
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMKRevYa_M

<small>Featured image: Photography of a recent oil painting by <a href="http://jackbangerter.net/" target="_blank">Jack Bangerter</a>. Jack writes: "There are spirit/shadows of the players represented by chess pieces. I was inspired by images of Ajax and Achilles playing a board game/planning a war on some Greek amphora pots."</small>]]></content:encoded>
