<h3>Book Wisdom</h3>
Steel read the <a href="https://www.poets.org/poetsorg/poem/spring-and-all-road-contagious-hospital" target="_blank">first section</a> from William Carlos Williams' 1923 book <em>Spring &amp; All</em>.]]></content:encoded>
