		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week Dave and Steel present the first episode of their new podcast Theme Songs. This week the theme is "Firsts!" and they play groundbreaking music by Kono Michi, Cat Stevens (Yusuf Islam), Bill Haley &amp; His Comets, Harry Belafonte, Bruce Springsteen, Domenico Modugno, Beck, Patty Griffin, and the Rolling Stones.

We hope you enjoy the new format. If you want to suggest a theme for a future episode of Theme Song, drop us a line at themesongspodcast AT gmail DOT com.

https://open.spotify.com/user/steelwagstaff/playlist/4tD8tI8vILtJba1H1gAxFO

<small>Featured image: super awkwardly-posed image of Bill Haley and his Comets from the mid-1950s.</small>]]></content:encoded>
