		<title><![CDATA[Theme Songs, Episode 2: "That Wasn't What I Was Expecting"]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/theme-songs-episode-2-that-wasnt-what-i-was-expecting/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 04 Sep 2017 08:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=794</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week's theme was 'That Wasn't What I Was Expecting' and we featured songs by bands whose musical sound doesn't match their name. On this week's episode Dave &amp; Steel are joined by their old friend Spencer to play music from bands with misleading names, including Los Campesinos!, The Final Solution, Yo La Tengo, Dr. Dog, Chinese Man, and St. Paul &amp; The Broken Bones.

https://open.spotify.com/user/steelwagstaff/playlist/6pZYgbqOPR6uQ4lYCZ1rob

<small><strong>Featured image:</strong> The faces of the three folks calling themselves "<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cTq2KZ5vrCw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yo La Tengo</a>." That feeling you're experiencing? That's called cognitive dissonance.</small>]]></content:encoded>
