		<title><![CDATA[Theme Songs, Episode 10: Songs to Clean Your House To]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/theme-songs-episode-10-songs-to-clean-your-house-to/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 15 Dec 2017 01:45:51 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=858</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week Dave and Steel were joined by Dave's sister Melissa to talk about music to clean your house to, with great tunes from LCD Soundsystem, Rufus Wainwright, James Brown, The Eagles, Radiohead, and Bomba Estéreo. You're in for a couple of extra special treats this week as well, as they also talked for a while about the worst things they've had to clean (a lot of poop talk, since Dave's a nurse and all three guests are parents), and Toad the Wet Sprocket's  bassist (and international sex symbol) Dean Dinning.

[caption id="" align="alignnone" width="450"]<img class="size-full" src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNjI2MTQzNzEyMF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTY3MzgyMQ@@._V1_.jpg" alt="Dean Dinning" width="450" height="298" /> Dean Dinning, Toad the Wet Sprocket bassist.[/caption]

https://open.spotify.com/user/steelwagstaff/playlist/6vAyYCsgQ9sUSDp7tRqvvO

<small>Featured image: Ben Lelis, "<a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/benleson/34398837895/in/photolist-UpH34Z-VAa8D5-nhvU5J-4uYCsv-DtB13-rwTo9z-nKSGjG-99MKjN-denCL9-5yjVGW-CBULW-4bbfya-CBUPa-SGRiPu-84j9cG-5yfxhk-5yjVWA-m4wL2T-diLwkm-aaGTB-5dozRy-aK8pcM-diLyVn-6CLbXg-9Cnf9t-m4wGfe-bBouSU-98dhn9-diLzYp-hfjuR-4F7wd-9TbQ21-diLx1y-diLvTy-74hTxy-5z8URQ-d4CnkU-zeCyf-3eCV9G-Ee4db-5djiJM-2sg4FT-3erQba-9TbLZN-9T8ZLr-9T92iD-9TbMG3-UYg5v7-XKfwMP-8SppMy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Mop</a>," CC-BY-NC-ND 2.0</small>]]></content:encoded>
