		<title><![CDATA[Theme Songs, Episode 15: Hair]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/theme-songs-episode-15-hair/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 15 Mar 2018 14:56:36 +0000</pubDate>
