		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=902</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week's theme was hair. Not only did Dave and Steel cover the greatest hair in <a href="https://www.bardown.com/the-2018-minnesota-state-high-school-all-hockey-hair-team-1.1023805" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Minnesota High School boy hockey</a> and their profound appreciation for what <a href="http://e00-marca.uecdn.es/assets/multimedia/imagenes/2017/12/01/15121083877872.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ricky Rubio</a> and <a href="https://goo.gl/images/L6DAuw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Elfrid Payton</a> are doing to revolutionize basketball hair this year, but they also played great hair-related music by P.M. Dawn, Pavement, The Cowsills, Old 97's, Hunx, and America. Enjoy!

https://open.spotify.com/user/steelwagstaff/playlist/75dzA1Xr6bpIlVGl5qJrba?si=ynQrzOQnSgmhqMyl4Y8msw

<small>Featured image: GIF of <a href="https://www.mnhockeyhub.com/roster_players/20956537" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Will Fisher</a> by <a href="https://twitter.com/shaynepasquino/status/971837037887279112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shayne Pasquino</a></small>]]></content:encoded>
