		<title><![CDATA[Theme Songs, Episode 17: Irresistible Dance Music]]></title>
		<link>https://otc.steelwagstaff.info/theme-songs-episode-17-irresistible-dance-music/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 30 Mar 2018 07:00:46 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[steel]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://otc.awesomecity.org/?p=909</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[This week's theme was Irresistible Dance Music. Dave &amp; Steel were joined by Steel's old friend Alice to talk about her love of ecstatic dance and play great dance tracks by Michael Jackson, Sly &amp; the Family Stone, Bag Raiders, MGMT, Disclosure, and Tani Diakite &amp; the Afrofunkstars.
<h2>Links</h2>
<ul>
 	<li>Tommy Franklin [Bag Raiders] appearance on Australia's Got Talent:</li>
</ul>
https://youtu.be/RJFt5YwAFZ8
